 "remarks": "Enjoy the convenience of downtown Stamford living in this top-floor corner unit. This well-maintained 2-bedroom, 1-bath residence offers 837 sq. ft. of comfortable living space with hardwood floors throughout. The inviting living room features a fireplace, while the spacious kitchen offers a window for natural light and ample room for everyday dining. Both bedrooms are generously sized with excellent closet space, and a full-size washer and dryer are conveniently located within the unit. The rent includes hot water, one reserved parking space, and additional storage. Ideally located near Stamford Town Center, restaurants, parks, public transportation, and the Metro-North station. Pets may be considered on a case-by-case basis. Excellent credit required.",
